# text.pdl - the words of the "next" line of the side panel (CONFIG). The panel is the same for every civ; the line says what to do next.
TEXT | next_pick | Next: press M for a unit
TEXT | next_walk | Next: walk to open land
TEXT | next_found | Next: press B to found
TEXT | next_endturn | Next: Space ends the turn
TEXT | next_move | Move, or Space ends turn
TEXT | next_end | Next: Space ends the turn
TEXT | setup_next | Up/Down pick, Left/Right change, Space starts
TEXT | civ_1_id | romans
TEXT | civ_1_name | Romans
TEXT | civ_1_leader | Caesar
TEXT | civ_1_colour | red
